      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這項服務是對那些老是\n做惡夢而睡不好的人們<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n使出催眠術，好讓他們入睡。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90199805670D52D9662F5C0D90A34E9B8001662F000A505A60E15922800C77614E0D597D76844EBA501100100001BE00000A4F7F51FA50AC77208853FF0C597D8B934ED6501151657761300200100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為最近被惡夢纏身的人\n也不少呢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA67008FD188AB60E159227E8F8EAB76844EBA000A4E5F4E0D5C1154622026202600100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我突然碰上了麻煩！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4662117A81713678B04E0A4E869EBB7169FF0100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "客人帶來的纏紅鶴\n就是不願意睡覺！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BA24EBA5E364F8676847E8F7D059DB4000A5C31662F4E0D9858610F776189BAFF0100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嚇咯。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "568754AF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可能是牠肚子裡累積了太多能量，\n讓牠怎樣都不肯入睡……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF80FD662F7260809A5B5088E17D2F7A4D4E86592A591A80FD91CFFF0C000A8B937260600E6A2390FD4E0D80AF516577612026202600100002011401BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "夢呣呣……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592254635463202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "服務才剛開始沒多久，\n夢夢蝕大概也很緊張吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
